.TH MOUTHTYPE-DESKTOP 1 "" "mouthtype-linux-desktop" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mouthtype-desktop \- Mouthtype settings window and tray icon for GNOME and KDE Plasma
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mouthtype-desktop
[\fB\-\-page\fR \fINAME\fR] [\fB\-\-background\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the Mouthtype settings window and tray icon. A second launch hands its \fB\-\-page\fR to the running instance.
On KDE Plasma the floating recording pill is shown too. Run \fBmouthtype-desktop \-\-help\fR for the full list.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mouthtype-linux (1),
.BR mouthtype-linux-setup (1)
